WEBVTT

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.730
Welcome to CivicView.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.990
Here's a quick look at how it works.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.290
Start with your address to see
who represents you in Congress:

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.530
your House member
and both of your senators.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.450
Or pick any state on
the map to see its governor,

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.190
statewide officials
and every state legislator.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.810
Select anyone to open their profile:
their background, committees,

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.020
the bills they've sponsored
and how they've voted,

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.890
all from public records.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.610
You can compare up to three side by side.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.750
Every official and candidate has a page.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.920
Once they claim it, they post updates,

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:43.330
polls and events there,
and you can respond in the open.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:46.730
Until then, citizens can
start polls about the office.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.720
The Polls page brings
polls from officials,

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.710
candidates and citizens
together in one feed.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.590
On Floor Bills, every seat
is a member of Congress.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.120
Select one to see their vote,

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.130
or open a plain English
guide to what the vote meant.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.680
The Elections tab shows
your state's key dates,

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.520
and the candidates
for Congress and governor

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:09.550
from your state's official lists.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:12.920
Follow the people,
bills and elections you care about,

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:14.750
and they gather in My Tracked.

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:17.460
The bell keeps you posted,
from new posts and events

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.630
to replies and reminders
before voting deadlines.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.180
Browsing is free with no account,

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:26.110
and a free demo account lets
you try everything today.

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:28.380
When verified accounts open, liking,

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:31.420
voting and commenting
will need an ID.me check,

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:34.430
and five dollars a month
adds starting your own polls.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.150
That's CivicView.

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:40.150
Explore at your own pace,
and reopen the tour anytime from the menu.
